<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · city</p><h1 class="enc-title">Charles Town, Jamaica</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Charles Town is a Maroon community in the parish of Portland in north-eastern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jamaica">Jamaica</a>, near the coastal town of Buff Bay. It was settled by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/windward-maroons">Windward Maroons</a> after the peace of 1739, and its people still maintain Maroon traditions, land rights and governance under an elected colonel.</p></div>
